       "Wait—dated explicitly by an inscribed Changsha bowl to 826 CE (six centuries BEFORE Zheng He's Ming treasure ships!).",
       "Sewn together with coconut-coir cord without a single iron nail, sailing straight through the Singapore/Malacca Straits.",
